[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Silicon Control: crash check
Name[it]=Silicon Control: controllo crash
Comment=Warns at login if the CPU profile was disabled after a crash
Comment[it]=Avvisa al login se il profilo CPU è stato disattivato dopo un crash
Exec=siliconctl notify
Icon=io.github.senseikiritof.SiliconControl
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
